      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path (33%):</strong> US acknowledges Iran's roadmap without accepting conditions; intermittent indirect sessions continue through US midterms; stalemate extends through November with no Hormuz reopening and F6 (ceasefire by Nov 15) unreached.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path (10%):</strong> US accepts Iran's 7-condition framework before Sep 28 (F2 resolves YES); phased Hormuz reopening begins; formal ceasefire takes effect before Nov 15 (F6 resolves YES).</p>
